0..78 Comment "//! A dependent arrow whose codomain ignores its binder is the plain arrow . A"
79..155 Comment "//! family applied at its binder is a dependent codomain until the family is"
156..234 Comment "//! read; a family that reads to one type at every argument makes the function"
235..294 Comment "//! type over it the arrow to that type, in both directions"
295..343 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]."
344..347 Comment "//!"
348..378 Comment "//! - see: #577 — `viaArrow`"
